        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "185. Pay for sick leave shall be that straight-time pay which the employee would have received had he/she worked his/her regular schedule that day, including any shift differential or split shift differential being received by the employee concerned. Paid sick leave shall count as time worked for purposes of computing overtime for hours worked later in the same work week.",
            "block_bbox": [
                152,
                194,
